        "sid": "ROM 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efwe khuli be kamaani mu lisuubila khwolaana khuyeete batekhele khulwe khubukula busiro bwabwe. Khukhesiimisia fwabeene tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali, fweesi khwolaana khusiimisie bawandaayefwe khulwe bulayi bwabwe, babeene nio khwole khubombakha mu lisuubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 69.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sikila Kristo se esiimisia omwene tawe. Ne kakhali nga liiandiko liboolanga lili, “Bukhomo nibwo bakhukhoma ewe bwakwa khwise.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli sisiindu sisiaandikwa mu maandiko siaandikwa khukhwikisia efwe, nio khwolaane khuba ne lilieyikina khubirira mu lifwiilisia ne khuramo kumwoyo nibio kamaandiko kaananga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Wele niye, liliefwiilisia ne khuramo kumwoyo biamangakho, amukhole enywe mube ne buambaani khu mwabeene ne mwabeene khulwe khuloonda likhola lia Kristo Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio enywe mweesi alala mwole khufumia Wele lundi Paapa owo Mwami wefwe Yesu Kristo ne kumumilo mulala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elomo Endayi khu Be Chikholo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, yakaanilana mwabeene ne mwabeene, khulwe luyali lwa Wele, nga Kristo amwakaanile enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila muboolela ndi bulamu bwe bukholi bwa Kristo bwaba khulwe Bayaudi, khukhwekesia khuli Wele ali omusuubilwa, khukhola lisuubisia liewe khu bakuuka babwe libe ng'ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.22.50"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 22.50",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.18.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 18.49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ne khukhola akhaba Be Chikholo banyale khufumia Wele khulwe siisa siewe. Nga liiandiko liboolanga lili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele niye lilieyikina liakukhakho oole khumwichusia enywe ne kumwikhoyo kwoosi ne kumuleembe khubirira mu lisuubila lienywe mu niye, nio lilieyikina lienywe lichiililile khuchoa khulwe bunyali bwa Roho Omutakatifu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sifuno sia Paulo sie khuandika ne bunyindaafu bukali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase. Ese samwene ne ulila ng'ali ndi enywe muli ne bulayi bukali, ndi muli ne bukesi bwoosi, mala mwabeene munyala khukhwekisiana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mu barwa yino nabeele ne bunyindaafu khulwe kamakhuwa nabulebe niko mukhebusie enywe. Nabeele omunyindaafu sikila bubweyaangu nibwo Wele ambelesie ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwe khuba omukholi owa Yesu Kristo khukholela Be Chikholo. Khola nga omusaayi mu khwilwacha Elomo Endayi khukhwama khu Wele, nio Be Chikholo boole khuba siianwa sifukiililwa khu Wele, sisiianwa khu niye ne Roho Omutakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, mu buambaani ne Yesu Kristo, nyala nesuunia khulwe bukholi bwase khulwa Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaba Omunyindaafu mala ndomalome khu niko Kristo akholile kong'ene khubirira mwise khukhola Be Chikholo barie Wele. Akholile kano khubirira mu makhuwa ne bikholwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khulwe bunyali bwe kamaya nende ke khuukia, ne khulwe bunyali bwa Roho owa Wele. Nono, khu lukeendo lwoosi khukhwama Yerusalemu khukhwola Iluriko, nelwachile elala Elomo Endayi khu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silukuluku siase buli lwoosi sibechanga khukhwilwacha Elomo Endayi abuundu niio bakhaulilakho Kristo tawe, nio khakholandio nombakha khu musiingi nikwo omundu okundi ombakha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.52.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 52.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga liiandiko ne liboolanga lili,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhwirekekha khwa Paulo khucha e Burumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar. 1.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Khwako nakhiingililwa biise bikali khumukeniia enywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne luno nga ne malile kimilimo kiase mungoongo chino lundi nga nama khwenyanga khulwe kimiiko kimikali niche mubone enywe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyikina khukhola ndio luno. Nenya khumubona enywe nendi khu lukeendo lwe khucha Sipeini, mala nenya munjeete nje eyo, enyuma we khukhwekhoyela khumubona enywe khulwe siise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.16.1+1CO.16.2+1CO.16.3+1CO.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakor. 16.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne luno luri, ndikho nja Yerusalemu mu bukholi bwe babaandu ba Wele ebweeneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila mu bulekhuule chikanisa mu Masedonia ne Akaya chabisia khuaana siianwa khuyeeta bataambi mu baandu ba Wele mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.9.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakor. 9.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Libisia elio liaba liliabwe babeene, ne, khulwa ng'ali, bakhoyela babayeeta nibo. Sikila Bayaudi basaanga mu khabi chabwe cha Roho nende Be Chikholo. Be Chikholo bolaana khurumikhira chikhabi che kimiaandu khuyeeta Bayaudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne khamale kimilimo kino mala mbaelesie chirupia choosi chiaanibwe khu nibo, kharakikhe lukeendo lwe khucha Sipeini ne khamukeniye enywe nendi khu lukeendo lwenolu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga nekheche khwinywe, manyile ndi kheche ne sikelo sisichufu sie chikhabi cha Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawandaayase ese muchuuba enywe, khulwo Mwami wefwe Yesu Kristo ne khulwe busiime nibwo Roho aananga. Ambaana ne nase khusabe ne kumwoyo kwoosi khu Wele, sikila ese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saba muli ndindwe bulayi khukhwama khu bakhasuubila tawe, bali mu Buyuda mala bukholi bwase mu Yerusalemu bwoole khufukiililwa ne babaandu ba Wele ebweeneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kheche khwinywe mu bwichufu bwe kumwikhoyo, liaba ne lili lilienya lia Wele, mala nekhoye khuolela mu bukeni ewenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele, niye kumuleembe kwefwe kwamakho, ole khuba alala ne nanywe mwesi. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo akheesia bakali mu Rumi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
